1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,970
Little friend...

25
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:56,770
Give me my disciple's Soul Blood.

26
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:57,570
Okay ?

27
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,490
So fast !

28
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:08,170
May I know the name of Senior's disciple ?

29
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,330
My disciple

30
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,770
is Zhou Zihong.

31
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,770
Alright.

32
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:18,130
Junior will travel 1000 li

33
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,410
and leave the Soul Blood there.

34
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,570
Little friend doesn't need to worry.

35
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,730
I’ve heard from Zihong that

36
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:35,050
the three of them returned safely to the War God Shrine

37
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,410
thanks to your help.

38
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:40,210
Even if you possessed this body,

39
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:42,850
you helped Zihong to return.

40
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:47,090
That is why I will overlook this matter.

41
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,450
Forgive me Senior,

42
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,610
Junior promises to give you the Soul Blood

43
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,130
after I travel 1000 li.

44
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:57,210
1000 li

45
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,650
is a distance that I

46
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:01,770
can cross in a few breaths.

47
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,570
If I wanted to kill you,

48
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:06,690
then unless you escaped 10 000 li away,

49
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:08,530
it would be pointless.

50
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,490
Fine,

51
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,090
if you insist,

52
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,810
then go.

53
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,490
Senior,

54
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:30,290
as we agreed, here’s the Soul Blood.

55
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,650
Whether that woman lied to me or not,

56
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,730
it isn't worth offending a Nascent Soul cultivator

57
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:39,810
over some Soul Blood.

58
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:50,290
He may only be Middle stage Foundation Establishment

59
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,450
but he’s exceedingly cautious.

60
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:58,850
Luo River Sect
Burning Fire country

61
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,290
Suppress the Earth Fire !

62
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,570
Don’t let it leak out !

63
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:15,050
Let's do it together !

64
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,450
What happened ?

65
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,350
Who trespassed in the Alchemy Hall ?

66
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,090
We don't know who this thief is

67
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:30,970
but he disguised himself as a disciple of the sect.

68
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:34,570
He tried to steal the Heaven Separating Pill that was just refined.

69
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:34,730
Li Qiqing
Luo River Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

70
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,290
The Heaven Separating Pill is unstable

71
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,810
and must be consumed within an hour.

72
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:41,210
Somehow, the thief knew our secret...

73
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:44,610
Luckily, Senior Sister Muwan was on duty and noticed.

74
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,570
Where’s Wan’er ?

75
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:46,610
Is she hurt ?

76
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,890
Senior Sister Muwan is unharmed.

77
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:51,050
She has already delivered the Heaven Separating Pill

78
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,370
to the Ancestor.

79
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,690
Good.

80
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,260
Let's split up,

81
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,970
we will catch this thief !

82
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,010
Even with my Ji Realm,

83
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:11,810
I’m no match for a Nascent Soul cultivator.

84
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:14,090
If she wanted to capture me,

85
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:16,130
I wouldn't be able to escape.

86
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:18,250
I can’t stay in the Burning Fire country.

87
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,890
Even if Lin Tao can get me a map in 10 days,

88
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:24,050
that plan can fail.

89
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:26,490
I saw in Ma Liang’s memories

90
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:29,050
that the Ravine Market holds the largest auctions here.

91
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:32,050
I'll see if I can find a map there.

92
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,970
His physique

93
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,810
matches the thief !

94
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,760
The thief is skilled in disguise !

95
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:42,610
Fellow cultivators,

96
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,570
what is wrong ?

97
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,810
You trespassed our sect’s restricted area.

98
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:47,170
Did you think that your disguise

99
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,290
would fool us again ?

100
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,650
You will die today !

101
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:56,050
Brother, stop !

102
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,690
Wan’er ?

103
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:08,690
Li Muwan
Luo River Sect disciple
Early stage Foundation Establishment

104
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:16,490
Brother, it’s not him.

105
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,890
The thief can change his appearance

106
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:22,130
but he couldn't have changed his aura to this extent.

107
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:33,370
This…

108
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,420
Fellow cultivator, forgive me.

109
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,170
I’m Li Qiqing of the Luo River Sect.

110
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,930
I apologize for the misunderstanding.

111
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,650
No problem.

112
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,450
Since it’s a misunderstanding,

113
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,690
how could I, Ma Liang, hold a grudge.

114
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,530
Young Master Ma,

115
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:53,610
are you heading to the Ravine Market ?

116
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:56,090
Maybe we can meet again.

117
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,490
Fellow cultivator,

118
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:03,250
I apologize for today’s incident.

119
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:05,130
We have urgent matters to deal with

120
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:06,090
so we’ll take our leave.

121
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,730
Continue the search !

122
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:22,650
Sun Youcai
Evil Devil Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

123
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,290
Fellow cultivator,

124
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,250
this is a misunderstanding !

125
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:29,450
Fellow cultivator, I’m Sun Youcai of the Evil Devil Sect

126
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:31,810
I didn't want to follow you earlier,

127
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,250
but I had to.

128
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,410
The Luo River Sect is looking for me

129
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,290
and I can't beat them.

130
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,330
I had to hide !

131
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,290
They are still looking for me

132
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,050
but if I follow you

133
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:48,450
then I will be a lot safer.

134
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,250
Fellow cultivator,

135
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,290
I truly apologize for earlier.

136
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:00,050
This guy is really fast...

137
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:00,050
Are you going to the Ravine Market ?

138
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,210
He’s only Late stage Foundation Establishment

139
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:03,770
but his speed nearly matches that Nascent Soul woman’s.

140
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:03,770
Why don't we go together ? I know a lot of people there.

141
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:06,170
Fellow cultivator, we should travel together.

142
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:07,250
Does he have a movement artifact ?

143
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,340
Fellow cultivator,

144
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,770
what do you think ?

145
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,530
Alright,

146
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:13,370
I’ll trouble Brother Sun then.

147
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,850
It's weird,

148
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:19,570
this kid is only Middle stage Foundation Establishment

149
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,970
but even if I am Late stage,

150
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,770
I'm somehow afraid of him.

151
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:27,050
No problem.

152
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,570
Afterall, I used your help first.

153
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,490
I'll take care of everything.

154
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,490
May I ask

155
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,650
fellow cultivator's name ?

156
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,290
I’m Ma Liang

157
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,650
of the War God Shrine.

158
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:40,330
Brother Ma, there is a

159
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:42,330
a teleportation formation to the Ravine Market.

160
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:44,570
That's great,

161
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,850
let's go there first then.

162
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,810
Brother Ma, are you traveling alone ?

163
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:49,810
Yes.

164
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,730
Brother Ma,

165
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:55,170
the formation requires 3 spirit stones.

166
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,610
I will call a friend,

167
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:58,090
he should be nearby.

168
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:00,890
That way, we can share the cost

169
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,490
and save up on 1 spirit stone.

170
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,850
What do you think ?

171
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:05,650
Okay

172
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,490
Don't worry Brother Ma,

173
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,850
I will pay your share.

174
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,050
If not for you,

175
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:20,290
the Luo River Sect would've caught me.

176
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,210
Brother Ma,

177
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,810
the teleportation formation is close

178
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:39,090
even if this place looks barren.

179
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:41,810
Lately, the volcanoes of the Burning Gold Mountains

180
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:44,250
have been emitting black smoke.

181
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,370
I think it was last year

182
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:48,130
that the 4 sects’ Nascent Soul Ancestors

183
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:49,250
strengthened the seal.

184
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:52,690
This remote place

185
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,250
is perfect for killing someone.

186
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:56,330
With so many volcanoes

187
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:59,090
disposing of a body is easy.

188
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,970
You don't even need fire spells.

189
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:04,570
Brother Ma, what do you mean by that ?

190
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:14,250
This person's cultivation is higher than Sun Youcai’s.

191
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,410
He's Peak Late stage.

192
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:15,770
Li Yong
Evil Devil Sect disciple
Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment

193
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,490
He's likely the mastermind behind this.

194
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:21,050
Is that the fat sheep you were talking about ?

195
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:22,410
Senior Brother, it’s him.

196
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:25,330
I saw Li Muwan and her brother Li Qiqing

197
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,650
had a good impression of him.

198
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:28,890
If we refine his body into a puppet,

199
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:31,090
we'll be have a better chance

200
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,890
at infiltrating the Luo River Sect again.

201
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:42,970
You can die now, kid.

202
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:44,810
Die.

203
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,210
What the...?

204
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:01,130
The Earth Escape Technique ?

205
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,330
Devour that purple mist.

206
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:11,970
I don't even know if I can devour it

207
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:13,690
and he told me to eat it like that ?

208
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,090
Now’s my chance

209
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:28,930
to escape.

210
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,490
I give up ! I give up !

211
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:36,810
I swear I won’t try again !

212
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,730
It would benefit me if I can obtain

213
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:44,290
his Earth Escape Technique.

214
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:52,050
Killing a Foundation Establishment cultivator with a single word

215
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:55,010
isn’t the level of Core Formation or Nascent Soul.

216
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:59,770
The legends say that Soul Formation cultivators can control the ways of the heavens.

217
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:02,210
So killing in a single word

218
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,290
would make sense...

219
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,090
Am I really

220
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:07,330
being hunted by a Soul Formation cultivator ?

221
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:10,730
Why is it getting warm ?

222
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,250
Could it be…?

223
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,570
Master,

224
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:27,330
there’s immense spiritual energy in the lava.

225
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:35,650
The Burning Fire country is covered in volcanoes

226
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:37,570
and somehow I ended in this one...

227
00:12:55,880 --> 00:12:58,850
How can creatures live in these volcanoes ?

228
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:02,850
If the Ancestors seal them every few years

229
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:05,180
then how did they miss this ?

230
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,730
I must leave quickly.

231
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:43,650
My Ji Realm attack failed !?

232
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:54,130
Hey, you're burning me !

233
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:03,090
Bye-bye Master !

234
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,970
This is bad !

235
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:49,850
This is…

236
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,890
the Fire spirit Beasts’ lair.

237
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:03,450
Why do they capture so many cultivators ?

238
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:17,210
This giant fire beast rivals Nascent Soul cultivation,

239
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:19,410
perhaps even stronger.

240
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:43,290
Why is the Heaven Defying Bead moving on its own ?

241
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:58,490
That ball of fire is devouring the cultivators...

242
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:49,890
That beast completed the whole fire element in one go.

243
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:54,290
Was it the Fire Spirit Beast King ?

244
00:17:09,420 --> 00:19:11,530
The amount of elemental spiritual energy needed to complete each element of the Heaven Defying Bead increases each time. That is why Wang Lin managed to upgrade it at first by using dew but now had to unearth an entire root of spirit fruits and it barely progressed the wood element. The Fire Spirit Beast King was enough to completely fill the fire element.

245
00:17:14,910 --> 00:17:20,800
I've been walking this path for endless years

246
00:17:17,210 --> 00:17:20,800
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

247
00:17:21,190 --> 00:17:26,400
Is it the compass of fate

248
00:17:23,030 --> 00:17:26,400
that wrote this outcome for us ?

249
00:17:26,310 --> 00:17:32,320
The heavens want to erase your existence,

250
00:17:32,190 --> 00:17:38,040
that's the obsession guiding me.

251
00:17:38,070 --> 00:17:43,640
Is this the path to uncover

252
00:17:39,950 --> 00:17:43,640
truths from falsehoods ?

253
00:17:43,670 --> 00:17:49,240
In a world of murk and shadow,

254
00:17:45,570 --> 00:17:49,240
only the flame of truth can light the way.

255
00:17:49,030 --> 00:17:54,960
Look at them all,

256
00:17:51,910 --> 00:17:54,960
being carried by the waves.

257
00:17:55,150 --> 00:17:59,600
Look at them all,

258
00:17:57,310 --> 00:17:59,600
being drowned.

259
00:17:59,430 --> 00:18:02,920
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

260
00:18:02,710 --> 00:18:06,000
I will let the world refine my soul.

261
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:11,560
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

262
00:18:07,570 --> 00:18:11,560
I will fight.

263
00:18:11,310 --> 00:18:14,680
I'll break through the abyss of despair

264
00:18:14,430 --> 00:18:17,720
to finally learn who I really am.

265
00:18:17,470 --> 00:18:23,080
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

266
00:18:19,350 --> 00:18:23,080
I embrace this obsession.

267
00:18:22,830 --> 00:18:26,040
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

268
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:28,840
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

269
00:18:28,590 --> 00:18:34,320
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

270
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:34,320
I'll still fight.

271
00:18:34,270 --> 00:18:37,680
It's hard to avoid loneliness

